e are more interested in this type of game let me know and I'll post a doc giving more details on how I see playing. <br /> <br /> thanks for reading.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/324-ardenty","name":"ardenty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar324_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-19T14:27:06-08:00","id":812119,"title":"","content":"So after a week or so of thinking I've decided to do a Play by Doc type game [ like play by post but instead of a forum we will use Goggle doc and skype] instead of a game with a set time frame.<br /> <br /> If this interests you let me know let me know again the game will mostly be Beast. If people are interested I'll post more detail in how the game might work<br /> <br /> Thanks for reading<br /> <br /> Edit: I must of hit new post instead of edit sorry","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>.","edited":{"userid":324,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/324-ardenty","user":"ardenty","date":".  double post 01-19-2016, 05:28 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/324-ardenty","name":"ardenty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar324_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-20T11:05:25-08:00","id":812732,"title":"","content":"I'd be interested in that for sure <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],